    "preamble": "K.Sakthivel vs The Commissioner on 12 September, 2024 W.P.No.2995 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated: 12.09.2024 Coram: The Honourable Mr.Justice G.Arul Murugan W.P.No.29954 of 2014 and M.P.No.01 of 2014 K.Sakthivel .... Pet Vs The Commissioner, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drugs Administration Department, No.359, Anna Salai, Dms Campus, Tyenampet, Chennai 600 006 ....Respondent Prayer : Writ Petition is filed under Article 226 of Constitution of In pleased to issue a Writ of Certiorarified Mandamus to call for the rec relating to the impugned proceedings issued by the Respondent in R.No.7770/2014/S1/FSSA dated 09.10.2014 and to quash the same and consequently direct the Respondent to consider the petitioner for tran the vacant post of Food Safety Officer in Coimbatore Corporation purel based on medical grounds as considered in similar cases. For Petitioner : Mr. S.Nedunchezhiyan For Respondents : Mr.Stalin Abimanyu Additional Government Pleader ________ https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis Page 1 of 4 W.P.No.29 ORDER",
